<div class="policy-page">
  <div class="policy-inner">
    <h1 class="policy-title">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="policy-date">Last updated: January 2026</p>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
      <p>Welcome to Nichey ("we", "our", "us"). By accessing or using our website nichey.store, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. Please read them carefully before placing any order.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>2. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>You must be at least 18 years old to use our services. By using Nichey, you confirm that you meet this requirement and that all information you provide is accurate and complete.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>3. Products & Authenticity</h2>
      <p>All products sold on Nichey are 100% authentic, sourced directly from official brand distributors and authorized suppliers. We do not sell counterfeit or grey market products. Product images are for illustration purposes and may slightly vary from the actual product.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>4. Pricing & Payment</h2>
      <p>All prices are listed in UAE Dirhams (AED) and include VAT where applicable. We reserve the right to change prices at any time without prior notice. Payment must be made in full before any order is processed and shipped.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>5. Orders & Cancellations</h2>
      <p>Once an order is placed and confirmed, it enters our processing system immediately. Cancellation requests must be made within 12 hours of placing the order. After this period, we cannot guarantee cancellation as the order may already be dispatched.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>6. Shipping</h2>
      <p>We ship across the UAE and internationally. Delivery times and shipping fees vary depending on your location. Please refer to our Shipping Policy page for full details. Nichey is not responsible for delays caused by customs or courier services.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>7. Returns & Refunds</h2>
      <p>We accept returns within 7 days of delivery for unopened and unused products in their original packaging. Products that have been opened or used cannot be returned unless they are defective. Please refer to our Returns Policy for full details.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All content on nichey.store including logos, images, text, and design is the property of Nichey and protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or use our content without prior written permission.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Nichey shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our website or products. Our liability is limited to the amount paid for the specific product or service in question.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>10. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to update these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Continued use of our website following any changes constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <h2>11. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@nichey.store">hello@nichey.store</a> or call us at <a href="tel:+971XXXXXXXXX">+971 XX XXX XXXX</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

